<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <title>Pixel GP - 2D 俯視角像素賽車 Demo (v0.5.1)</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com/3.4.17"></script>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      user-select: none;
      -webkit-user-select: none;
      -webkit-touch-callout: none;
    }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #0b0f19;
      color: #f8fafc;
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      overflow: hidden;
      touch-action: none;
    }
    .mono {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    }
    canvas {
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      image-rendering: crisp-edges;
      display: block;
    }
    .retro-border {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.7), 0 6px 16px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
    }
    .touch-btn {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78);
      border: 2px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      transition: transform 0.05s ease, background-color 0.05s ease, border-color 0.05s ease;
    }
    .touch-btn:active, .touch-btn.active {
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.88);
      border-color: #fde047;
      transform: scale(0.93);
    }
    /* Ergonomic thumb zone heights for mobile devices */
    .thumb-zone-low {
      bottom: calc(3.25rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    }
    .thumb-zone-mid {
      bottom: calc(5.75rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    }
    .thumb-zone-high {
      bottom: calc(8.5rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="h-[100dvh] w-screen flex flex-col bg-slate-950 overflow-hidden">

  <!-- Top Header / Telemetry Bar (Responsive Fixed-Row Structure: All top buttons 100% visible on Mobile & PC, zero dynamic jumping, full Track & Corner names visible!) -->
  <header class="w-full bg-slate-900/95 border-b border-slate-800 px-2 sm:px-3 py-1 flex flex-col gap-1 z-20 shrink-0">
    <!-- Top Section: Timers + Quick Action Controls (Stacks cleanly on Mobile so buttons never get pushed off-screen; side-by-side on PC) -->
    <div class="w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between gap-1">
      <!-- Timers Row -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-auto flex items-center justify-between lg:justify-start gap-1.5 sm:gap-3.5 text-[11px] sm:text-sm mono whitespace-nowrap">
        <span id="hudTrackBadge" class="inline-flex items-center px-1.5 sm:px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-extrabold bg-emerald-600 text-white tracking-wider uppercase mono shrink-0">IMOLA · EASY</span>
        <div>
          <span class="text-slate-400">LAP</span>
          <span id="hudLap" class="font-bold text-white ml-0.5">1/3</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-slate-400">TIME</span>
          <span id="hudCurTime" class="font-bold text-emerald-400 ml-0.5">00:00.00</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-slate-400">BEST</span>
          <span id="hudBestTime" class="font-bold text-amber-400 ml-0.5">--:--.--</span>
        </div>
        <div id="ghostDeltaContainer" class="hidden md:flex items-center">
          <span class="text-slate-400">Δ GHOST</span>
          <span id="hudGhostDelta" class="font-bold text-slate-400 ml-1">--.--s</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Action Buttons (6-column full-width grid on mobile so ALL buttons are 100% visible; inline flex on PC) -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-auto grid grid-cols-6 lg:flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0">
        <button id="btnToggleAutoGas" type="button" class="px-1 sm:px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-950/90 hover:bg-emerald-900 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-200 border border-emerald-700/80 transition text-center whitespace-nowrap">
          ⚡自動:開
        </button>
        <button id="btnTogglePadHeight" type="button" class="px-1 sm:px-2 py-1 rounded bg-indigo-950/90 hover:bg-indigo-900 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-indigo-200 border border-indigo-700/80 transition text-center whitespace-nowrap">
          📱高度:中
        </button>
        <button id="btnToggleGhost" type="button" class="px-1 sm:px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-800/80 transition text-center whitespace-nowrap">
          👻殘影:開
        </button>
        <button id="btnCarSelect" type="button" class="px-1 sm:px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 transition text-center whitespace-nowrap">
          🏠主選單
        </button>
        <button id="btnResetCar" type="button" class="px-1 sm:px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 transition text-center whitespace-nowrap">
          🔄重置
        </button>
        <button id="btnToggleMute" type="button" class="px-1 sm:px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 transition text-center whitespace-nowrap">
          🔊音效:開
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Section: Dedicated Full Track Name & Full Corner Name Bar (Fixed single-line per item on Mobile, side-by-side on PC — 100% visible, never dynamically wraps or jumps!) -->
    <div class="w-full flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-0.5 sm:gap-3 pt-0.5 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-[11px] sm:text-xs whitespace-nowrap overflow-hidden">
      <div class="h-4 sm:h-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-200 font-bold shrink-0">
        <span class="text-slate-400 font-normal">🏁 賽道:</span>
        <h1 id="hudTrackFullName" class="font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Autodromo Enzo e Dino Ferrari (Easy)</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="h-4 sm:h-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 mono font-semibold text-amber-300 shrink-0">
        <span id="cornerNameBadge">📍 Traguardo (Start / Finish Line) (0%)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Viewport Container -->
  <main id="gameContainer" class="relative flex-1 w-full h-full overflow-hidden bg-emerald-950">
    <canvas id="gameCanvas" class="w-full h-full"></canvas>

    <!-- Top-Left Compact Live Physics & Mode Indicator -->
    <div class="absolute top-2 left-2 pointer-events-none flex flex-col gap-1 z-10 max-w-[162px] sm:max-w-[205px]">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/75 border border-slate-700/70 backdrop-blur-sm px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg retro-border">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span id="hudSpeed" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold mono text-white">0</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mono">KM/H</span>
          </div>
          <span id="hudDrsBadge" class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-extrabold mono bg-slate-800/90 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700">
            DRS OFF
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-1.5 bg-slate-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-1 border border-slate-700">
          <div id="hudSpeedBar" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-amber-400 to-red-500 w-0 transition-all duration-75"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-1 text-[10px]">
          <span id="hudGripState" class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold mono text-[10px] bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/40 truncate w-full text-center">
            🟢 GRIP 貼地抓地
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-between gap-1 text-[10px] text-slate-300 mono truncate">
          <span id="hudCarTitle" class="truncate">平衡型</span>
          <span id="hudSurface" class="truncate text-right">柏油(100%)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mobile Corner Name & Progress Pill -->
      <div id="mobileCornerBadge" class="hidden">
        📍 Traguardo
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Top-Right Compact & Transparent Mini-Map -->
    <div class="absolute top-2 right-2 pointer-events-none flex flex-col items-end z-10">
      <div class="bg-slate-950/25 border border-slate-600/35 backdrop-blur-[2px] p-1.5 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-200/90 uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5 mono px-0.5 drop-shadow">
          <span id="minimapTitle">IMOLA</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 inline-block"></span>
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400 inline-block"></span>
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 inline-block"></span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <canvas id="minimapCanvas" width="112" height="66" class="rounded bg-transparent"></canvas>
        <div class="w-full flex justify-between gap-1.5 text-[9px] mt-0.5 mono font-semibold drop-shadow">
          <span id="hudSector1" class="text-red-400">S1:--</span>
          <span id="hudSector2" class="text-sky-400">S2:--</span>
          <span id="hudSector3" class="text-amber-300">S3:--</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Center Toast Notification -->
    <div id="centerToast" class="hidden absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none z-20 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/95 border-2 border-amber-400 text-center shadow-2xl">
      <div id="centerToastTitle" class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-amber-300 mono uppercase">LAP COMPLETED</div>
      <div id="centerToastSub" class="text-xs text-slate-200 mono mt-0.5">00:24.50</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Ergonomic On-Screen Touch Controls -->
    <div id="touchControlsBar" class="absolute inset-x-3 sm:inset-x-6 thumb-zone-mid flex items-end justify-between pointer-events-none z-10 transition-all duration-150">
      <!-- Left Hand: Ergonomic Steering Cluster -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3.5 pointer-events-auto pl-1 sm:pl-2">
        <button id="btnSteerLeft" type="button" aria-label="左轉" class="touch-btn w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-white shadow-xl">
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold leading-none">◀</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-300 mt-1 mono font-bold">LEFT (A)</span>
        </button>
        <button id="btnSteerRight" type="button" aria-label="右轉" class="touch-btn w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-white shadow-xl -translate-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold leading-none">▶</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-300 mt-1 mono font-bold">RIGHT (D)</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Center Help Hint on Desktop -->
      <div class="hidden xl:flex flex-col items-center bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-[11px] text-slate-300 mono mb-2">
        <span>電腦鍵盤: <strong class="text-white">W/S 或 ↑/↓</strong> 油門煞車 · <strong class="text-white">A/D 或 ←/→</strong> 轉向 · <strong class="text-amber-300">SPACE</strong> 甩尾</span>
        <span class="text-emerald-300">地面已繪製彎道編號 (T1~T19) 與紅黃轉向箭頭看板 · 鈴鹿橋下/橋上立體分層</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Hand: Large Ergonomic Brake / Drift Pedal -->
      <div class="flex items-end gap-2.5 sm:gap-3.5 pointer-events-auto pr-1 sm:pr-2">
        <button id="btnPedalBrake" type="button" aria-label="煞車與飄移" class="touch-btn w-24 h-20 sm:w-28 sm:h-24 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-amber-300 border-amber-400/75 shadow-xl -translate-y-1">
          <span class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold leading-none mono">BRAKE / DRIFT</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-200 mt-1.5 mono font-bold">減速/起飄(S)</span>
        </button>
        <button id="btnPedalGas" type="button" aria-label="油門加速" class="hidden touch-btn w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-emerald-300 border-emerald-500/70 shadow-xl -translate-y-4">
          <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold leading-none mono">GAS</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-200 mt-1 mono font-bold">全油門 (W)</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- =================================================================== -->
    <!-- MAIN MENU OVERLAY (Game Mode, Track Selection, Lap Count & Vehicle) -->
    <!-- =================================================================== -->
    <div id="garageModal" class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/92 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center p-2.5 sm:p-4 z-30">
      <div class="bg-slate-900 border-2 border-slate-700 rounded-2xl max-w-3xl w-full p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-2xl max-h-[94dvh] overflow-y-auto">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-2.5">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-extrabold bg-red-600 text-white mono uppercase">MAIN MENU · v0.5.1</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 mono">CLEAR CORNERS · NON-OVERLAPPING 8-CAR TRACKS</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-white mt-0.5">PIXEL GP — 像素大獎賽主選單</h2>
          </div>
          <button id="btnCloseGarage" type="button" class="hidden px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs font-semibold">
            繼續比賽 ✕
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 1: Game Mode Tabs & Lap Selector -->
        <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-between gap-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-xl p-2.5">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 mono mr-1">MODE:</span>
            <button id="modeTimeTrial" type="button" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-red-600 text-white text-xs font-extrabold mono shadow">
              ⏱️ 計時模式 (Time Trial)
            </button>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/90 text-slate-500 text-[11px] font-semibold border border-slate-800 mono">
              🔒 街機模式 (8車AI · v0.6預定)
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/90 text-slate-500 text-[11px] font-semibold border border-slate-800 mono">
              🔒 生涯車隊模式 (Career · v0.7預定)
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Lap Count Selector -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 mono">圈數 (LAPS):</span>
            <button type="button" data-laps="1" class="lap-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs font-bold mono border border-slate-700">1</button>
            <button type="button" data-laps="3" class="lap-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 text-xs font-extrabold mono border border-amber-400 shadow">3</button>
            <button type="button" data-laps="5" class="lap-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs font-bold mono border border-slate-700">5</button>
            <button type="button" data-laps="10" class="lap-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs font-bold mono border border-slate-700">10</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2: Select Circuit (Imola Easy / Suzuka Normal / Monte Carlo Hard) -->
        <div class="mt-3.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mono">1. SELECT CIRCUIT (已拉開所有鄰近路段間距 · 強化低速彎角與地面指標)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5">
            <!-- Imola (Easy) -->
            <div id="track-imola" data-track="imola" class="track-card cursor-pointer rounded-xl p-3 bg-slate-800/95 border-2 border-emerald-500 transition hover:bg-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-1">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/40 mono">★☆☆ 簡單 EASY</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mono">義大利 · 19彎</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-white mt-1.5">伊莫拉 · Imola</h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-snug">高速流暢的逆時針經典賽道，路面寬敞（320px），適合練習貼地過彎與高速入彎起飄。</p>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-700/60 flex justify-between text-[10px] mono text-slate-300">
                <span>賽道寬度: 8車寬</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">最佳: <span id="menuBest-imola">--:--.--</span></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Suzuka (Normal) -->
            <div id="track-suzuka" data-track="suzuka" class="track-card cursor-pointer rounded-xl p-3 bg-slate-800/50 border-2 border-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-1">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-300 border border-sky-500/40 mono">★★☆ 普通 NORMAL</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mono">日本 · 18彎(8字立體橋)</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-white mt-1.5">鈴鹿 · Suzuka</h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-snug">鮮明的連續 S 彎、Degner 直角彎、180° 髮夾彎、湯匙彎與真正分層繪製的立體交叉高架橋！</p>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-700/60 flex justify-between text-[10px] mono text-slate-300">
                <span>賽道寬度: 8車寬</span>
                <span class="text-sky-400 font-bold">最佳: <span id="menuBest-suzuka">--:--.--</span></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Monte Carlo / Monaco (Hard) -->
            <div id="track-monaco" data-track="monaco" class="track-card cursor-pointer rounded-xl p-3 bg-slate-800/50 border-2 border-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-1">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40 mono">★★★ 困難 HARD</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mono">摩納哥 · 19彎街道</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-white mt-1.5">蒙地卡羅 · Monaco</h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-snug">重塑超大港灣間距！突出 Fairmont 180° 髮夾彎、海濱折返彎、泳池 S 彎與最後 Rascasse/T19 直角彎！</p>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-700/60 flex justify-between text-[10px] mono text-slate-300">
                <span>賽道寬度: 8車寬</span>
                <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">最佳: <span id="menuBest-monaco">--:--.--</span></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3: 3 Car Spec Cards -->
        <div class="mt-3.5">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mono mb-1.5">2. SELECT YOUR VEHICLE (選擇參賽車輛 · 保持靈巧車體比例)</div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5">
            <!-- Balanced -->
            <div id="card-balanced" data-car="balanced" class="car-card cursor-pointer rounded-xl p-3 bg-slate-800/95 border-2 border-red-500 transition hover:bg-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-500/20 text-red-300 border border-red-500/40 mono">BALANCED</span>
                  <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 inline-block border border-white"></span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white mt-1">平衡型 · Rosso GT</h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">抓地與甩尾表現均衡，入彎指向穩定，三條賽道皆能穩定發揮。</p>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-[10px] mono">
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>極速 Speed</span><span class="text-white font-bold">295 km/h</span></div>
                <div class="w-full bg-slate-950 h-1.5 rounded-full"><div class="bg-red-500 h-1.5 rounded-full" style="width: 80%"></div></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>貼地抓地 Grip</span><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">85%</span></div>
